On Thursday 24 April 2003 02:37 am, Linus Gasser wrote:
> Hello,
> yesterday I had a pleasant surprise: kdegames is in unstable,
> again! What is the magic behind it? And it seems that
> lyx-1.3.1 now works for alpha, too, though I didn't test it
> yet. This is great news for somebody who uses an alpha at
